	(text "Fuse at the cell, one per tap. Presence: pin 13 tied to the B0 return. 1 A tap: 0.1455 Ohm, 63 V, 50 A interrupt (below the pack short-circuit current: rely on wire impedance or a higher breaking part, open).\nBalance current through the fuse adds about 44 mV of sense error at 150 mA across two taps."
